<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss November inflation falls to 0.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss November inflation falls to 0.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss consumer prices fell 0.2 percent in November from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.7 percent, the Federal Statistics Office said.  </p>
<p>				    Nov 1996	Oct 1996	Nov 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.2 pct	+0.2 pct	-0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.7 pct	+0.8 pct	+1.9 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  103.5	   103.7	   102.8</p>
</text>
